    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Pancake Patrol - A Delicious Fusion of Bullet Heaven and Bullet Hell!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic quest to <strong>deliver pancakes to Pembrook's Manor</strong> in this action-packed roguelite. Battle through hordes of monsters with your arsenal of culinary weapons, facing off against <strong>unique bullet hell bosses</strong> with challenging mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587840/extras/648d1286c23788a0ddc1e4f2cd0afff3.poster.avif?t=1749670604\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587840/extras/648d1286c23788a0ddc1e4f2cd0afff3.webm?t=1749670604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587840/extras/648d1286c23788a0ddc1e4f2cd0afff3.mp4?t=1749670604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>bullet hell battles</strong> where you become the storm, in a pancake-themed roguelite. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and mix <strong>food-based weapons</strong> like the <strong>Whip(ped) Cream</strong> and <strong>Maple Syrup Tornado</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>thrilling game modes</strong> like the adrenaline-pumping <strong>Boss Rush with 10 epic showdowns</strong>, the chaotic <strong>Horde Mode</strong> with wild modifiers, the heart-racing <strong>Bacon Rush</strong> where you dodge sizzling bacon bullets unarmed, the intense <strong>True Bullet Hell</strong> where you weave through a storm of projectiles, and the exhilarating <strong>Bullet Heaven</strong> classic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>10 unique characters</strong>, each offering a different playstyle and abilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587840/extras/1a9a1ef5b498422f78c8790ddbfa58c6.poster.avif?t=1749670604\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587840/extras/1a9a1ef5b498422f78c8790ddbfa58c6.webm?t=1749670604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587840/extras/1a9a1ef5b498422f78c8790ddbfa58c6.mp4?t=1749670604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in <strong>1v1 boss fights</strong>, mastering each boss's patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on the <strong>Leaderboards</strong> and unlock <strong>Steam Achievements</strong> to prove your prowess.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Pancake Patrol - A Delicious Fusion of Bullet Heaven and Bullet Hell!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic quest to <strong>deliver pancakes to Pembrook's Manor</strong> in this action-packed roguelite. Battle through hordes of monsters with your arsenal of culinary weapons, facing off against <strong>unique bullet hell bosses</strong> with challenging mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587840/extras/648d1286c23788a0ddc1e4f2cd0afff3.poster.avif?t=1749670604\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587840/extras/648d1286c23788a0ddc1e4f2cd0afff3.webm?t=1749670604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587840/extras/648d1286c23788a0ddc1e4f2cd0afff3.mp4?t=1749670604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>bullet hell battles</strong> where you become the storm, in a pancake-themed roguelite. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and mix <strong>food-based weapons</strong> like the <strong>Whip(ped) Cream</strong> and <strong>Maple Syrup Tornado</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>thrilling game modes</strong> like the adrenaline-pumping <strong>Boss Rush with 10 epic showdowns</strong>, the chaotic <strong>Horde Mode</strong> with wild modifiers, the heart-racing <strong>Bacon Rush</strong> where you dodge sizzling bacon bullets unarmed, the intense <strong>True Bullet Hell</strong> where you weave through a storm of projectiles, and the exhilarating <strong>Bullet Heaven</strong> classic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>10 unique characters</strong>, each offering a different playstyle and abilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587840/extras/1a9a1ef5b498422f78c8790ddbfa58c6.poster.avif?t=1749670604\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587840/extras/1a9a1ef5b498422f78c8790ddbfa58c6.webm?t=1749670604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587840/extras/1a9a1ef5b498422f78c8790ddbfa58c6.mp4?t=1749670604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in <strong>1v1 boss fights</strong>, mastering each boss's patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on the <strong>Leaderboards</strong> and unlock <strong>Steam Achievements</strong> to prove your prowess.</p>",
    "short_description": "Deliver pancakes, crush monster hordes, and duel epic bullet hell bosses in this delicious roguelite! Unlock outrageous food weapons, master intense patterns, and conquer Boss Rush. Choose your hero and join the unstoppable Pancake Patrol today!",
